{"title":"Dune Elemental","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 41 Sand Elemental that attacks with crush (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">corrode</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">crush</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">burn</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">slash</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 5 times (3.4% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      <p class=\"s\">Special: carapaceFlat: 5 | regrowthFracPerSec: .01</p>\n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/fulgurite-shard\">Fulgurite Shard</a> <span class=\"muted\">(infuses an enchant)</span>. A small chance on any kill, far better from elites. <a href=\"#/guide/quality-and-enchanting\">Reforging</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dune-elemental\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dune-elemental?lv=41\">Lv 41 <span>13</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dune-elemental?lv=42\">Lv 42 <span>86</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/dune-elemental?lv=43\">Lv 43 <span>50</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/dune-elemental?lv=41\" title=\"Pick level 41\"><td><b>41</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>203</td><td>27.1</td><td>2,050</td><td class=\"muted\">609 · 37.9 · 6,150</td><td>13</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Storm-Buried%20Caravan\">Storm-Buried Caravan</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/dune-elemental?lv=42\" title=\"Pick level 42\"><td><b>42</b></td><td>212</td><td>27.6</td><td>2,100</td><td class=\"muted\">636 · 38.6 · 6,300</td><td>86</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Storm-Buried%20Caravan\">Storm-Buried Caravan</a></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/dune-elemental\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>43</b></td><td>222</td><td>28.2</td><td>2,150</td><td class=\"muted\">666 · 39.5 · 6,450</td><td>50</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Storm-Buried%20Caravan\">Storm-Buried Caravan</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"dune-elemental\" data-map-level=\"43\">Show level 43 on the map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 17 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"sand-core\" title=\"Sand Core - in 82% of 17 looted corpses, 12 recorded drops, 48 total, 2–6 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/dd2f532fec666b02e71c.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Sand Core</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">82% · 14/17</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"stamina-potion-large\" title=\"Stamina Potion Large - in 12% of 17 looted corpses, 2 recorded drops, 2 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/7fdf25f5efb0344b88a4.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Stamina Potion Large</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">12% · 2/17</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"ogrewax-legs\" title=\"Ogrewax Legs - in 6% of 17 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/661962eb273d384bc5cd.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogrewax Legs</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">6% · 1/17</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Good: 1 of 1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"tome-leatherworking-werewolfpelt\" title=\"Tome Leatherworking Werewolfpelt - in 6% of 17 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/60228315d5b6e5c42496.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Tome Leatherworking Werewolfpelt</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">6% · 1/17</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+3 more\">+3 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"werewolfpelt-head\" title=\"Werewolfpelt Head - in 6% of 17 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/69bc975155db9bef5f6d.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Werewolfpelt Head</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">6% · 1/17</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"mana-potion-large\" title=\"Mana Potion Large - in 6% of 17 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/a4a127458a5f5f489058.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Mana Potion Large</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">6% · 1/17</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"werewolfpelt-feet\" title=\"Werewolfpelt Feet - in 6% of 17 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/79897c1ee4bf7477b88b.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Werewolfpelt Feet</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">6% · 1/17</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Good: 1 of 1</span></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>⭐ Elite loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link elite\" data-item=\"sand-core\" title=\"Sand Core - in 82% of 17 looted corpses, 2 recorded drops, 20 total, 7–13 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/dd2f532fec666b02e71c.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Sand Core</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">82% · 14/17</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link elite\" data-item=\"fulgurite-shard\" title=\"Fulgurite Shard - in 6% of 17 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/bd84404c123fb8e4bf22.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Fulgurite Shard</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">6% · 1/17</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Percentages are of the corpses whose loot the collector recorded, so kills you did not loot are not counted.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Storm-Buried%20Caravan\">Storm-Buried Caravan</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 61 spots</span></li><li>in the wilds around 2076, 804 <span class=\"muted\">· 11 spots</span></li><li>in the wilds around 2050, 1199 <span class=\"muted\">· 6 spots</span></li><li>in the wilds around 2015, 816 <span class=\"muted\">· 4 spots</span></li><li>in the wilds around 2007, 1218 <span class=\"muted\">· 4 spots</span></li><li>in the wilds around 2009, 835 <span class=\"muted\">· 4 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Thak%20Vanguard%20Camp\">Thak Vanguard Camp</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 1 spot</span></li><li>in the wilds around 2030, 840 <span class=\"muted\">· 1 spot</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"dune-elemental\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Sand Elemental: <a href=\"#/monster/sand-elemental\">Sand Elemental</a> <span class=\"muted\">(38)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/glasswrought-colossus\">Glasswrought Colossus</a> <span class=\"muted\">(44)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/77761b474a7384a1df3e.webp\" alt=\"Dune Elemental\"></div><h3>Dune Elemental</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td><b>43</b> <span class=\"muted\">(picked · base 41)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Sand Elemental</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>crush · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>222</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>28.2</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>2,150</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>4.2 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>1.6</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>No</td></tr><tr><th>Pendant / cape</th><td>Can drop</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>145 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}